---
import Base from '@layouts/Base.astro';
import { contact, cta } from '@config/site';

const company = 'Neno';
const slug = 'neno-brief-56e07372';
const deckHref = `/deliveries/${slug}/deck.pdf`;
const appendixHref = `/deliveries/${slug}/appendix.pdf`;
---

<Base
  title="Neno — Private Intelligence Brief"
  description="Private Evidence Axis intelligence delivery prepared for Neno."
  path={`/intelligence/${slug}/`}
  noindex={true}
>
  <main
    class="gift10"
    data-delivery-tracking
    data-delivery-company={company}
    data-delivery-slug={slug}
  >
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap hero-inner">
        <p class="eyebrow">PRIVATE EVIDENCE AXIS DELIVERY</p>
        <h1>Neno</h1>
        <p class="recipient">Prepared for Nick Knuppe · Founder & CEO</p>
        <p class="lede">Competitive pressure on AI differentiation, Dutch back-office convergence, and the outcome layer worth defending before GTM spend scales.</p>

        <div class="file-actions" aria-label="Intelligence files">
          <a class="file-button deck" href={deckHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-delivery-event="executive-deck-opened">
            <span class="num">01</span>
            <span class="copy"><small>EXECUTIVE VIEW</small><strong>Open Executive Brief</strong><em>PDF ↗</em></span>
          </a>
          <a class="file-button appendix" href={appendixHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-delivery-event="evidence-appendix-opened">
            <span class="num">02</span>
            <span class="copy"><small>EVIDENCE VIEW</small><strong>Open Evidence Appendix</strong><em>PDF ↗</em></span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <p class="hint">Open the Executive Brief first. The Appendix contains the source register, evidence labels, competitor boundaries and guardrails behind it.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="finding">
      <div class="wrap narrow">
        <p class="eyebrow dark">ONE FINDING TO START WITH</p>
        <blockquote>AI alone is becoming a weaker differentiator before Dutch GTM scales.</blockquote>
        <p>Exact is already embedding named agents into core accounting workflows at installed-base scale, while Qonto and Shine/Cegid are broadening adjacent finance workflows. The brief therefore tests whether Neno’s stronger boundary sits higher: finished work, system ownership and accountable service.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="read">
      <div class="wrap read-grid">
        <div><p class="eyebrow dark">HOW TO READ THE WORK</p><h2>Confidence never outruns the evidence.</h2></div>
        <div class="states">
          <div><b>FACT</b><span>Directly supported by an opened and checked source.</span></div>
          <div><b>INFERENCE</b><span>An analytical conclusion built from disclosed evidence.</span></div>
          <div><b>UNKNOWN</b><span>The reviewed public evidence does not support a stronger claim.</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="next">
      <div class="wrap narrow">
        <p class="eyebrow dark">IF THIS RAISES A REAL DECISION</p>
        <h2>Pressure-test the outcome layer next.</h2>
        <p>The public evidence shows what is moving. A paid decision sprint can add Neno’s pipeline, lost deals, buyer objections and market priorities to determine which competitive claim should carry Dutch GTM and which 2027 market has the cleanest advantage.</p>
        <a class="cta" href={`${cta.secondary.href}&company=${encodeURIComponent(company)}`} data-delivery-event="decision-conversation-clicked">Discuss a Competitive Decision →</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main></Base>

<style>
  .gift10{background:#f7f2ea;color:#0c1420}
  .wrap{width:min(1120px,calc(100% - 2rem));margin:0 auto}
  .narrow{max-width:900px}
  .hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:clamp(5.5rem,9vw,8.5rem) 0 4.5rem;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 12%,rgba(255,126,34,.13),transparent 31%),radial-gradient(circle at 50% 100%,rgba(81,108,178,.1),transparent 38%),#07090f;color:#f7fbff}
  .hero::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,.018),transparent 34%)}
  .hero-inner{position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:920px;text-align:center}
  .eyebrow{margin:0;font:700 .68rem/1.2 var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.16em;color:#ff8c35}
  .eyebrow.dark{color:#b85f1b}
  .hero h1{margin:1rem 0 0;font-size:clamp(4.75rem,10.5vw,9.4rem);line-height:.86;letter-spacing:-.065em;color:#fff;text-wrap:balance;text-shadow:0 14px 46px rgba(0,0,0,.24)}
  .recipient{margin:1.25rem 0 0;color:#c8ced8;font:650 .74rem/1.45 var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.055em}
  .lede{max-width:760px;margin:1.35rem auto 0;color:#dce1e8;font-size:clamp(1rem,1.55vw,1.16rem);line-height:1.65;text-wrap:balance}
  .file-actions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.9rem;width:min(820px,100%);margin:2.65rem auto 0;text-align:left}
  .file-button{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:1.15rem;align-items:center;padding:1.35rem 1.45rem;border:1px solid rgba(255,140,53,.3);border-radius:1rem;text-decoration:none;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(28,31,40,.98),rgba(13,16,22,.98));color:#fff;box-shadow:0 18px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.26);transition:transform .2s ease,border-color .2s ease,background .2s ease}
  .file-button:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:#ff8c35;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(35,38,48,.98),rgba(16,19,27,.98))}
  .file-button.appendix:hover{border-color:#9aabff}
  .num{font:800 2rem/1 var(--font-mono);color:#ff8c35}
  .appendix .num{color:#9aabff}
  .copy{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:.3rem .75rem;align-items:end}
  .copy small{grid-column:1/-1;font:700 .58rem/1 var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.12em;color:#9ea8b6}
  .copy strong{font-size:clamp(1.02rem,2vw,1.2rem);line-height:1.2}
  .copy em{font-style:normal;color:#ff8c35;font:700 .68rem/1 var(--font-mono);white-space:nowrap}
  .appendix .copy em{color:#9aabff}
  .hint{max-width:760px;margin:1.15rem auto 0;color:#8f99a8;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.55}
  .finding,.read,.next{padding:clamp(4rem,7vw,6rem) 0}
  .finding{background:#f1e9de}
  .finding blockquote{margin:1rem 0;font:750 clamp(2rem,4.2vw,4rem)/1.05 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.045em}
  .finding p:last-child,.next p{color:#5e6b7c;line-height:1.7}
  .read{background:#fff}
  .read-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:4rem;align-items:center}
  .read h2,.next h2{margin:.7rem 0;font-size:clamp(2.3rem,4vw,4rem);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.04em}
  .states{display:grid;gap:.75rem}
  .states div{display:grid;gap:.35rem;padding:1rem;border:1px solid #d9e0e8;border-radius:.8rem}
  .states b{font:800 .7rem/1 var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.1em;color:#b85f1b}
  .states span{color:#5e6b7c}
  .next{background:#f7f2ea}
  .cta{display:inline-flex;margin-top:1rem;padding:.9rem 1.15rem;border-radius:.7rem;background:#0b1522;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750}
  @media(max-width:760px){
    .read-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}
    .hero{padding-top:4.75rem}
    .hero h1{font-size:clamp(3.75rem,18vw,5.7rem)}
    .recipient{font-size:.68rem}
    .file-button{padding:1.15rem 1.1rem;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr}
    .num{font-size:1.65rem}
    .copy{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .copy em{margin-top:.1rem}
  }
</style>
